{
  "name": "dsh-thinking-slider",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "思考强度滑条（Thinking Slider）：接管输入框右侧那枚官方的「模型 · 推理等级」chip（隐藏官方座位），把推理等级从菜单点选换成可拖拽的滑条——拖动中连续跟手、松手吸附到最近档位并且只提交一次请求；轨道内自绘填充、刻度点与白圆钮，只有最高档（xhigh/max/ultra）才铺品牌色流动渐变，轨道两端标出最低/最高档名，同一张卡片还能展开官方模型清单。键盘 ←/→、Home/End、PageUp/PageDown 按整档移动并自动提交；用目录对象上的世代计数器丢弃迟到的响应；数据全部取自官方 ctx.modelDirectories，不新增任何能力。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "preview": "node preview/build-preview.mjs && node preview/serve.mjs",
    "publish": "node tools/publish.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/LihiHe/dsh-thinking-slider.git"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "reasoning-effort",
    "thinking",
    "slider",
    "composer"
  ]
}
